{"id":"en_divorce-me-if-you-dare","title":"Divorce Me If You Dare","titleEn":"Divorce Me If You Dare","description":"After three decades without contact, Veronica’s estranged husband suddenly reappears, bringing a new wife and son with him and asking for a divorce. Yet the woman he abandoned is no longer the person he once knew. Her sons have become national heroes, while their wives hold influential roles that shape global affairs. What he expects to be a simple separation turns into something far more complicated than he anticipates. The series follows this confrontation as Veronica faces the man who left her behind, now backed by a family whose standing he clearly failed to consider. Divorce Me If You Dare can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/7d83d71fda4ee879/zh_TW/9782818ad3d5a28e/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/7d83d71fda4ee879/zh_TW/9782818ad3d5a28e/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Comeback","Comeback","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dn61u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_divorce-me-if-you-dare_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dn61u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_divorce-me-if-you-dare_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dn61u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_divorce-me-if-you-dare_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dn61u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_divorce-me-if-you-dare_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Fr